  "description": "Unofficial .NET client for TypeSafe's Jev System One model: ask Noul, Choice, Score, and Box questions about text, structured state, or images and get typed answers back. Includes retries, timeouts, logging, and dependency-injection support.",
  "id": "Jev.DotNet",
