  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: Jev 1.14 support (https://typesafe.ai/blog/jev-1-14).\n- Images: SystemOneRequest.Assets with ImageAsset (PNG/JPEG from file, stream, bytes, or base64), referenced anywhere in state, instructions, or criteria.\n- Box questions: Question.Box(...) returns a BoxAnswer with a fractional BoundingBox, Confidence, Pad(), and ToPixels(). Requires jev-1.14.0+.\n- Danger zone opt-ins: DangerZone.Images and DangerZone.LongContext (262k-token context), per call via RequestOptions or per client via JevClientOptions.\n- New JevClientOptions.PreviewModelName (\"jev-preview\"); docs cover jev-1.14.0.\n- Debug logs truncate request bodies over 16 KB.",
